        "title": "",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "text": "<p>At Gaia, our vision has always been to create a space where our members can come together as a community to experience more, connect deeper, and evolve further. This dream has become a reality with <a href=\"https://marketplace.gaia.com/\" title=\"https://marketplace.gaia.com/\">Gaia Marketplace</a>.</p><p>The truth is, as a Gaian, you are helping to change the world. Gaia Marketplace was created to ensure you have access to the spiritual adventures, cutting-edge education, loving relationships, and conscious products you need to fuel your path forward.</p><p>This platform is your central hub, with exclusive and hand-curated offerings intentionally chosen and backed by research for exceptional quality and impact. We invite you to <a href=\"/collections/transformative-experiences\" title=\"Retreats & Tours\">travel to exotic locations worldwide</a>, participate in transformative <a href=\"/collections/personal-growth-courses\" title=\"Courses & Training Programs\">courses and training programs</a>, attend soul-enriching <a href=\"/collections/upcoming-events\" title=\"Live Events & Meetups\">events and workshops</a>, connect deeply with fellow members, and elevate your life with <a href=\"/collections/conscious-products\" title=\"Conscious Products\">conscious products</a>. It's our aspiration for this platform to serve you well, and we're thrilled to provide special member-only discounts.</p><p>As we stand proudly behind our vision to empower the evolution of consciousness and our mission to create a transformational network that supports a globally conscious community, we extend our deepest gratitude to you. You are integral to our shared mission and humanity's evolution.</p><p>It is an honor to walk alongside you on this journey of awakening.</p><p>Sincerely,<br/><br/>James Colquhoun<br/><em>Gaia CEO</em></p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "center",
        "image_width": "33",
        "layout": "center_bottom",
