        "text_jehetf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>At Gaia, our vision has always been to create a space where our members can come together as a community to experience more, connect deeper, and evolve further. This dream has become a reality with <a href=\"https://marketplace.gaia.com/\" title=\"https://marketplace.gaia.com/\">Gaia Marketplace</a>.</p><p>The truth is, as a Gaian, you are helping to change the world. And Gaia Marketplace was created to ensure you have access to the spiritual adventures, cutting-edge education, ancient explorations, and conscious products you need to fuel your transformation. </p><p>This platform is your central hub, with exclusive and hand-curated offerings intentionally curated with exceptional quality. Everything inside Marketplace passes the Gaia stamp of approval. We invite you to <a href=\"https://gaiamarketplace.myshopify.com/collections/transformative-experiences\" title=\"Retreats & Tours\">travel to exotic locations worldwide</a>, participate in transformative <a href=\"/collections/personal-growth-courses\" title=\"Courses & Training Programs\">courses and training programs</a>, attend soul-enriching <a href=\"https://gaiamarketplace.myshopify.com/collections/upcoming-events\" title=\"Live Events & Meetups\">events and workshops</a>, connect deeply with fellow members, and elevate your life with <a href=\"https://gaiamarketplace.myshopify.com/collections/conscious-products\" title=\"Conscious Products\">conscious products</a>. We aspire for this platform to serve you well, and we're thrilled to provide special member-only discounts.</p><p>As we stand proudly behind our vision to empower the evolution of consciousness and our mission to create a transformational network that supports a globally conscious community, we extend our deepest gratitude to you. You are integral to our shared mission and humanity's evolution.</p><p>It is an honor to walk alongside you on this journey of awakening.</p><p>Sincerely,<br/><br/>James Colquhoun<br/><em>Gaia CEO</em></p><p></p><p></p>"
